### Reject an invalid PATCH hazard ID
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/hazards/not-a-number
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated hazard",
  "description": "Updated description.",
  "category": "Construction",
  "current_status": "reported",
  "severity": 3,
  "latitude": 49.2827,
  "longitude": -123.1207,
  "image_url": null
}

### Accept a valid hazard update
### Expected: 200 OK
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/hazards/{{createHazard.response.body.$[0].hazard_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated validation hazard",
  "description": "The valid test hazard has been updated.",
  "category": "Construction",
  "current_status": "in_progress",
  "severity": 4,
  "latitude": 49.2827,
  "longitude": -123.1207,
  "image_url": null
}

### Reject an invalid DELETE hazard ID
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/hazards/not-a-number

### Return 404 when deleting a hazard that does not exist
### Expected: 404 Not Found
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/hazards/999999999

### Delete the valid test hazard
### Expected: 200 OK
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/hazards/{{createHazard.response.body.$[0].hazard_id}}

### Confirm the deleted hazard no longer exists
### Expected: 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:3001/api/hazards/{{createHazard.response.body.$[0].hazard_id}}